    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Assimilation Swarm",
    "summary": "During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), every **HARVESTER** unit of yours may Regenerate a **TYRANIDS** unit of yours up to 6\" away from it; a unit can be regenerated just once per phase. Each regeneration does one of these:\n\n- A model in the regenerated unit gets back as many as D3+1 lost wounds.\n- A **destroyed** **INFANTRY** model (not a **CHARACTERS** model) rejoins the regenerated unit at full wounds; for an **ENDLESS MULTITUDE** unit, as many as 3 come back instead.",
